Subject: [PATCH 11/14] gdb/dyld cache: send base of a loaded library and
 shared cache data to bfd

Rebased onto gdb 18.1: solib_check_bfd_matches_target uses gdb_bfd_check_format and styled file names; struct solib keeps its out-of-line constructor; get_darwin_info uses try_emplace.
